+
+### Conceptual data flow
+
+```
+ EXTERNAL WORLD                         ORGANISATIONS
+ (feeds, regulation)                    (executives self-assess)
+      │                                        │
+      ▼                                        ▼
+  SIGNALS (classified)                 DPI + ASSESSMENTS (responses)
